e upgrading from a previous version",\n      "Whether you need enterprise management tools",\n      "Your procurement or volume requirements"\n    ],\n    "aboutHeading": "Voice Recognition Australia - Dragon's longest-serving Australian partner",\n    "aboutBody": "Voice Recognition Australia has been the go-to resource for Dragon Professional in Australia since the product launched locally. We provide genuine local support, onboarding, and deployment guidance - not just a licence key. Our team has deployed Dragon across government departments, legal chambers, medical practices, and large enterprise environments.",\n    "footerDisclaimer": "Dragon, Dragon Professional, and related marks are the property of Nuance Communications (Microsoft). Voice Recognition Australia is an authorised Australian reseller. Pricing accurate at time of publication - verify current pricing at voicerecognition.com.au before purchase. All prices AUD including GST."\n  },\n  "navItems": [\n    { "label": "Why Dragon", "url": "#benefits" },\n    { "label": "Pricing", "url": "#compare" },\n    { "label": "Compare", "url": "/comparison" },\n    { "label": "FAQ", "url": "#faq" },\n    { "label": "Contact", "url": "#final-cta" }\n  ],\n  "navDropdown": {\n    "label": "Products",\n    "items": [\n      { "label": "Dragon Professional 16", "url": "/dragon-professional-16" },\n      { "label": "Upgrade from v15", "url": "/dragon-professional-16-upgrade" },\n      { "label": "Annual Subscription", "url": "/dragon-professional-16-subscription" },\n      { "label": "Student / Education", "url": "/dragon-professional-16-student" },\n      { "label": "Enterprise (Group)", "url": "/dragon-professional-group" }\n    ]\n  },\n  "primaryCTA": { "text": "Get in Touch", "url": "#final-cta" },\n  "secondaryCTA": { "text": "Compare Versions", "url": "/comparison" },\n  "form": {\n    "id": "283",\n    "submitText": "Request Information",\n    "hiddenU": "283",\n    "hiddenF": "283",\n    "hiddenOr": "452040ae-e495-4c74-bd95-dc0f67e3edd8"\n  },\n  "stats": [\n    { "value": "40 years", "label": "Trusted in market" },\n    { "value": "15M+", "label": "Users worldwide" },\n    { "value": "from $495", "label": "Upgrade price AUD" },\n    { "value": "15 days", "label": "Free trial" }\n  ],\n  "products": [\n    {\n      "slug": "dragon-professional-16",\n      "heroImageKey": "product-perpetual-hero",\n      "featureImageKey": "product-perpetual-feature",\n      "badge": "Perpetual Licence",\n      "navLabel": "Dragon Professional 16",\n      "title": "Dragon Professional 16",\n      "metaTitle": "Buy Dragon Professional 16 | $994 AUD | Perpetual Licence | VRA Australia",\n      "metaDesc": "Dragon Professional 16 perpetual licence for Windows. Buy once, own forever. Dictate, transcribe and automate workflows. Local Australian support from Voice Recognition Australia.",\n      "headline": "Dragon Professional 16 - Own It Forever",\n      "subheadline": "The full-featured professional speech recognition suite for Windows. Pay once, own it permanently. Dictate into any application, transcribe single-speaker recordings, and automate repetitive tasks with custom voice commands.",\n      "price": "$994",\n      "priceNote": "AUD inc GST - one-time perpetual",\n      "licenceNote": "Licensed per user. Activate on up to 2 PCs.",\n      "installLimit": "Up to 2 PCs",\n      "bestFor": "Professionals who want to own forever",\n      "vraUrl": "https://www.voicerecognition.com.au/cart/add?id=44931726508278&quantity=1",\n      "infoUrl": "https://www.voicerecognition.com.au/collections/dragon-professional/products/dragon-professional-16-download",\n      "ctaText": "Buy Dragon Professional 16",\n      "highlight": false,\n      "features": [\n        "Real-time dictation into Word, Outlook, and hundreds of Windows applications",\n        "Transcribe single-speaker audio recordings (MP3, WAV, WMA, DSS, DS2)",\n        "Custom vocabulary - add industry terms, names, and shortcuts",\n        "AutoText - speak a short phrase to insert a full paragraph",\n        "Voice macros to automate multi-step Windows workflows",\n        "Works offline after installation and activation",\n        "Hands-free PC control, navigation, and mouse control",\n        "Windows 10 and Windows 11 (32-bit and 64-bit) compatible",\n        "Compatible with Microsoft 365, Google Docs, and more"\n      ],\n      "faqs": [\n        {\n          "q": "Does Dragon Professional 16 require an internet connection to use?",\n          "a": "No. After installation and activation, Dragon Professional 16 operates without an internet connection. An internet connection is required only for the initial download and product activation."\n        },\n        {\n          "q": "How many PCs can I install Dragon Professional 16 on?",\n          "a": "Dragon Professional 16 is licensed per user and can be activated on up to 2 Windows PCs under a single licence."\n        },\n        {\n          "q": "Can Dragon Professional 16 transcribe meeting recordings?",\n          "a": "Dragon Professional 16 can transcribe audio files containing a single speaker. It is not designed for multi-speaker conversations, interviews, or meetings. Supported formats include MP3, WAV, WMA, DS2, and DSS."\n        },\n        {\n          "q": "Is this a subscription or a one-time purchase?",\n          "a": "This is a perpetual licence - a one-time purchase. You pay once and own the software permanently with no annual renewal fees."\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      "slug": "dragon-professional-16-upgrade",\n      "heroImageKey": "product-upgrade-hero",\n      "featureImageKey": "product-upgrade-feature",\n      "badge": "Upgrade Pricing",\n      "navLabel": "Upgrade from v15",\n      "title": "Dragon Professional 16 Upgrade",\n      "metaTitle": "Dragon Professional 16 Upgrade from v15 | $495 AUD | VRA Australia",\n      "metaDesc": "Upgrade from Dragon Professional 15 to Dragon Professional 16. $495 AUD inc GST. Windows 11 compatibility, improved accuracy, updated Office support. Australian reseller.",\n      "headline": "Dragon Professional 16 - Upgrade from Version 15",\n      "subheadline": "Already using Dragon Professional 15? Upgrade to v16 for Windows 11 compatibility, improved Microsoft 365 support, and the latest accuracy improvements. Save over $499 compared to buying new.",\n      "price": "$495",\n      "priceNote": "AUD inc GST - upgrade from v15 only",\n      "licenceNote": "Requires Dragon Professional Individual or Group v15 licence key.",\n      "installLimit": "Up to 2 PCs",\n      "bestFor": "Existing Dragon v15 users",\n      "vraUrl": "https://www.voicerecognition.com.au/cart/add?id=44931746595062&quantity=1",\n      "infoUrl": "https://www.voicerecognition.com.au/collections/dragon-professional/products/dragon-professional-16-upgrade",\n      "ctaText": "Buy the Upgrade",\n      "highlight": false,\n      "features": [\n        "Full Dragon Professional 16 licence - all features included",\n        "Save $499 compared to full perpetual purchase price",\n        "Windows 11 and Windows 10 full compatibility",\n        "Updated Microsoft 365, Office 2021, and Teams support",\n        "Improved multi-monitor support",\n        "Your existing custom vocabulary and profiles carry over",\n        "Requires Dragon Professional Individual or Group v15 licence key",\n        "Upgrade valid from v15 only - not older versions or other editions"\n      ],\n      "faqs": [\n        {\n          "q": "Which versions of Dragon can use this upgrade?",\n          "a": "This upgrade is for Dragon Professional Individual or Dragon Professional Group version 15 only. It cannot be applied to Dragon version 14 or older, or to Dragon Home or Legal editions."\n        },\n        {\n          "q": "What do I need to complete the upgrade?",\n          "a": "You need your Dragon Professional v15 licence key available during installation. The upgrade installer checks